1144
02:26:15,000 --> 02:26:16,000
PRA Assistant General Manager Joseph John M. Literal: Yes, Sir.

1145
02:26:16,000 --> 02:26:28,000
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: Ang sinasabi dito, kapag ka ang national government or local government ay nag-reclaim at unauthorized, pwede silang mag-apply na mapunta sa kanila. Hindi ibig sabihin na pag wala silang permit, pwede lang ituloy-tuloy.

1146
02:26:28,000 --> 02:26:38,000
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: So, you have to decide now. Do you have jurisdiction over LLDA or not? If you have, then you have to stop all of the illegal reclamation.

1147
02:26:38,000 --> 02:26:40,000
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: Ongoing ngayon yung DPWH project.

1148
02:26:40,000 --> 02:26:54,000
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: Na damuhala ang laki compared sa tagig. Na hindi nag-submit sa inyo ng feasibility study. Na hindi nag-submit sa inyo ng environmental study. So, you will ignore that? Bakit?

1149
02:26:54,000 --> 02:26:55,000
PRA Assistant General Manager Joseph John M. Literal: No, Sir.

1150
02:26:55,000 --> 02:26:58,000
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: No, you're ignoring it now. You're not asking them to stop it.

1151
02:26:58,000 --> 02:27:00,000
PRA Assistant General Manager Joseph John M. Literal: Sir, we are now coordinating.

1152
02:27:00,000 --> 02:27:05,000
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: No, no, no, no. You're not coordinating. You do not have a letter to cease and desist. You do not have a letter to show cause.

1153
02:27:05,000 --> 02:27:08,000
PRA Assistant General Manager Joseph John M. Literal: Sir, we have a letter with the DPWH.

1154
02:27:08,000 --> 02:27:09,000
PRA Assistant General Manager Joseph John M. Literal: Telling them to stop it.

1155
02:27:09,000 --> 02:27:10,000
PRA Assistant General Manager Joseph John M. Literal: Telling them to stop it.

1156
02:27:10,000 --> 02:27:20,000
PRA Assistant General Manager Joseph John M. Literal: And then they also filed, Sir, the information about the LLRN, Your Honor. It's part of our CSW at present.

1157
02:27:20,000 --> 02:27:30,000
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: Okay. Sundan ko, Honorable Board, sundan ko logic ng inyong deputy. So, kung yan ang gawin ng tagig, wala na tayong problema?

1158
02:27:30,000 --> 02:27:32,000
PRA Assistant General Manager Joseph John M. Literal: Sir, yes, Sir.

1159
02:27:32,000 --> 02:27:35,000
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: So, pag sinubmit nila yung information, tapos pinakita nila ng gobyerno.

1160
02:27:35,000 --> 02:27:37,000
PRA Assistant General Manager Joseph John M. Literal: Sir, we'll go through the process, Your Honor.

1161
02:27:37,000 --> 02:27:42,000
PRA Assistant General Manager Joseph John M. Literal: Of the regularization of the unauthorized projects.

1162
02:27:42,000 --> 02:27:50,000
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: Okay. So, I'll ask you. Hindi sinasubmit sa inyo ng DPWH kasi sa Friday nandito sila. Sino proponent ng LLRN?

1163
02:27:50,000 --> 02:27:53,000
PRA Assistant General Manager Joseph John M. Literal: Sir, it's Laguna Lake Development Authority and DPWH.

1164
02:27:53,000 --> 02:27:55,000
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: No, no, no. No, it's DPWH.

1165
02:27:55,000 --> 02:27:56,000
PRA Assistant General Manager Joseph John M. Literal: Yes, Sir.

1166
02:27:56,000 --> 02:28:00,000
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: Okay. O, sino ang proponent ng mga sinisist and desist nyo sa tagig?

1167
02:28:00,000 --> 02:28:01,000
PRA Assistant General Manager Joseph John M. Literal: DPWH also, Your Honor.

1168
02:28:01,000 --> 02:28:02,000
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: O, sila din eh.

1169
02:28:02,000 --> 02:28:03,000
PRA Assistant General Manager Joseph John M. Literal: Kaya po.

1170
02:28:03,000 --> 02:28:05,000
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: O, so you're, no. I want to get information from you now.

1171
02:28:05,000 --> 02:28:06,000
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: So that I can confirm.

1172
02:28:06,000 --> 02:28:08,000
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: So that I can confront them on Friday.

1173
02:28:08,000 --> 02:28:12,000
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: So, you're telling me now sa LLRN.

1174
02:28:12,000 --> 02:28:13,000
PRA Assistant General Manager Joseph John M. Literal: Sila po.

1175
02:28:13,000 --> 02:28:16,000
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: Nagko-coordinate sila. Pero sa tagig projects hindi sila nagko-coordinate.

1176
02:28:16,000 --> 02:28:17,000
PRA Assistant General Manager Joseph John M. Literal: Sir, nagko-coordinate din po sila.

1177
02:28:17,000 --> 02:28:20,000
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: O, eh bakit mo sinisist and desist yung isa? Nagko-coordinate na pala eh.

1178
02:28:20,000 --> 02:28:24,000
PRA Assistant General Manager Joseph John M. Literal: Sir, that's part of the cease and desist order.

1179
02:28:24,000 --> 02:28:25,000
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: No, I'm trying to see, Sir.

1180
02:28:25,000 --> 02:28:26,000
PRA Assistant General Manager Joseph John M. Literal: Yes, Sir.

1181
02:28:26,000 --> 02:28:35,000
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: If you're doing selective justice here. You have two projects. One is more than ten times bigger. One is ten times smaller. Same proponent.

1182
02:28:36,000 --> 02:28:41,000
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: One is even more useful than the other. May gumagamit na ba nung highway ngayon?

1183
02:28:41,000 --> 02:28:42,000
PRA Assistant General Manager Joseph John M. Literal: Nung LLRN, Sir?

1184
02:28:42,000 --> 02:28:43,000
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: Oo.

1185
02:28:43,000 --> 02:28:44,000
PRA Assistant General Manager Joseph John M. Literal: Wala pa po.

1186
02:28:44,000 --> 02:28:45,000
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: Oo. So, wala pang public use yun?

1187
02:28:45,000 --> 02:28:46,000
PRA Assistant General Manager Joseph John M. Literal: Yes, Sir.

1188
02:28:46,000 --> 02:28:51,000
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: Sir, with your permission, Mr. Chairman. This is a one-minute video. Can you show the one-minute video?

1189
02:29:02,000 --> 02:29:03,000
Senator Erwin Tulfo: Yes?

1190
02:29:06,000 --> 02:29:09,000
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: Yes, Sir.

1191
02:29:13,000 --> 02:29:23,000
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: O, Mr. Literal. That is the linear park na ginagawa ngayon. That is public use. Hindi private yan.

1192
02:29:25,000 --> 02:29:35,000
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: Pag Christmas, 30,000 people a night dun sa 2 hectare na yan. Pwera pa dun. Okay. Hindi ba yan ay public use?

1193
02:29:36,000 --> 02:29:37,000
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: Hindi.

1194
02:29:37,000 --> 02:29:41,000
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: Okay. Yung tinap niyo, shophouses.

1195
02:29:41,000 --> 02:29:42,000
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: Ano pa?

1196
02:29:42,000 --> 02:30:00,000
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: Shophouses. Singapore. Lahat ng Pilipino sinasabi, sanang may ganito tayo sa Pilipinas. Ginagawa ngayon. Yung katabi, I'm not at liberty to tell you who designed it. He's one of the best designers in the country na environmentalist na ginagamit ng national government.

1197
02:30:00,000 --> 02:30:07,200
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: Ang katabi na susunod na gagawin ay yung parang fund to make sure na walang erosion para sa environment.

1198
02:30:07,820 --> 02:30:09,840
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: Did you know that yun ang isang STINAP niya?

1199
02:30:12,140 --> 02:30:13,120
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: Did you know that?

1200
02:30:13,400 --> 02:30:13,740
PRA Assistant General Manager Joseph John M. Literal: No, sir.

1201
02:30:15,080 --> 02:30:19,620
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: Have you ever written the city of Taguig to ask about the project?

1202
02:30:20,000 --> 02:30:23,980
PRA Assistant General Manager Joseph John M. Literal: Sir, we have written the city of Taguig last October 2025.

1203
02:30:23,980 --> 02:30:30,360
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: No, no, that's not my question. My question is, have you ever written the city of Taguig to ask them about the projects?

1204
02:30:31,580 --> 02:30:32,640
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: About the lots.

1205
02:30:32,900 --> 02:30:43,940
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: Okay. Ang sinasabi mo, nagsalita ka sa bilyonaryo, ang sabi niyo po, sir, may show cost order kayo sa city.

1206
02:30:44,160 --> 02:30:44,540
PRA Assistant General Manager Joseph John M. Literal: Yes, sir.

1207
02:30:45,000 --> 02:30:48,560
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: Can you show me sa letter, saan nakalagay dito show cost?

1208
02:30:49,080 --> 02:30:53,960
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: Binasa ko yung letter pa ulit-ulit. Ang nakalagay dito, ma'am, pakibigay yung mga tito.

1209
02:30:53,980 --> 02:31:01,880
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: Ang nakalagay dito, ma'am, ano yung project? Wala pong nakalagay dito show cost. Wala po.

1210
02:31:02,160 --> 02:31:07,140
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: Ang nakalagay dito, itong mga lupa na ito may titolo, pakita titolo sa PRA.

1211
02:31:07,860 --> 02:31:13,120
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: Ang nakapirma po dito, sir, kayo po. Kaya kayo po tinatanong kasi taga-DNR po kayo.

1212
02:31:13,800 --> 02:31:15,160
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: So, balikan ko yun, sir, ha?

1213
02:31:15,260 --> 02:31:15,560
PRA Assistant General Manager Joseph John M. Literal: Yes, sir.

1214
02:31:15,660 --> 02:31:20,160
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: Sir, kung magtatanong tayo ng titolo, saan po tayo magtatanong?

1215
02:31:21,360 --> 02:31:23,960
PRA Assistant General Manager Joseph John M. Literal: Ang mga titolo po ay hinahawakan.

1216
02:31:23,980 --> 02:31:26,920
PRA Assistant General Manager Joseph John M. Literal: Hinahawakan po ng Land Management Bureau.

1217
02:31:27,000 --> 02:31:32,780
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: Okay. So, alam nyo ba, sir, na inibitahan ng staff ko si chairman sa opisina ko nung sinulat nyo ito?

1218
02:31:33,380 --> 02:31:33,820
PRA Assistant General Manager Joseph John M. Literal: Opo.

1219
02:31:34,180 --> 02:31:35,400
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: Alam nyo kung anong sinabi namin?

1220
02:31:36,220 --> 02:31:37,220
PRA Assistant General Manager Joseph John M. Literal: Hindi ko po alam, sir.

1221
02:31:37,240 --> 02:31:40,540
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: Sabi namin, ayaw namin magmukakay yung incompetent sa PRA.

1222
02:31:41,240 --> 02:31:44,260
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: Kasi, sino ang susulat sa mayor para humingi ng titolo?

1223
02:31:44,940 --> 02:31:47,220
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: Hindi naman po registrar of deeds ang asawa ko, eh.

1224
02:31:48,120 --> 02:31:49,720
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: Ang mayor po, hindi naman na ano, eh.

1225
02:31:50,320 --> 02:31:52,060
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: Ito po, project ng DPWH.

1226
02:31:52,060 --> 02:32:00,700
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: Lahat ng lupa po na nandyan ay pagmamay-ari ng LLDA under a Republic Act.

1227
02:32:01,760 --> 02:32:08,620
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: Kaya nung pagdaan ni chairman, if you remember, chairman, sa plenary wala po kayo.

1228
02:32:09,560 --> 02:32:10,940
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: So, hinanap ko po kayo.

1229
02:32:11,660 --> 02:32:18,540
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: Dahil matagal na kaming magkaibigan nung pamilya ni chairman, pati nung tatay niya ay kaibigan na kaibigan ng tatay ko.

1230
02:32:18,540 --> 02:32:21,520
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: Ang kapatid niya ay kabatch ko, di ba?

1231
02:32:22,060 --> 02:32:23,760
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: Ang mga pinsan niya, kaibigan ko.

1232
02:32:24,580 --> 02:32:27,840
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: Pagdaan sa office ko, tinanong lang, sir, ano problema?

1233
02:32:28,140 --> 02:32:33,740
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: At tinanong ko ng staff ko, sir, ba't kayo nagtatanong ng titolo sa mayor at may problema ba dito?

1234
02:32:34,200 --> 02:32:35,860
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: Kaya sabi niya, hindi, mag-coordinate na lang.

1235
02:32:36,780 --> 02:32:42,280
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: At sinabi ng staff ko, sir, ang magko-coordinate, DPWH, kasi hindi naman po project ng tagig yan, eh.

1236
02:32:43,040 --> 02:32:44,180
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: Project ng DPWH.

1237
02:32:44,960 --> 02:32:49,180
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: Kaya ang tinanong pa nga ni chairman, kailangan ko ba maghintay dahil birthday nung anak niya?

1238
02:32:49,920 --> 02:32:51,840
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: At tinawagan ako ng staff ko, sabi ko, hindi, hindi.

1239
02:32:52,060 --> 02:32:59,900
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: Kaya ako lang sila gusto makausap para linawin sa budget, pero kung namamadali at kung mag-uusap-usap naman lahat ng opisina natin, bakit hindi?

1240
02:33:00,900 --> 02:33:02,200
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: Tama, chairman? More or less?

1241
02:33:02,820 --> 02:33:03,920
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: More or less lang, di ba?

1242
02:33:04,320 --> 02:33:07,000
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: Oh, so meron po ba akong pananakot sa PRA?

1243
02:33:08,300 --> 02:33:10,720
Senator Erwin Tulfo: With the indulgence of the minority leader.

1244
02:33:11,160 --> 02:33:12,820
Senator Erwin Tulfo: I just have two quick questions.

1245
02:33:12,940 --> 02:33:13,240
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: Oh, go ahead.

1246
02:33:13,300 --> 02:33:13,860
Senator Erwin Tulfo: Very quick lang.

1247
02:33:14,900 --> 02:33:17,180
Senator Erwin Tulfo: I would like to address this to the PRA.

1248
02:33:17,180 --> 02:33:22,040
Senator Erwin Tulfo: When is the approval of PRA needed for reclamation project?

1249
02:33:22,060 --> 02:33:24,600
Senator Erwin Tulfo: Can any one of you answer that?

1250
02:33:25,000 --> 02:33:25,600
Senator Erwin Tulfo: Attorney literal.

1251
02:33:26,060 --> 02:33:33,560
Senator Erwin Tulfo: Kailan ika nga ang kailangan ng approval ng PRA para sa isang reclamation project?

1252
02:33:33,760 --> 02:33:33,960
Senator Erwin Tulfo: When?

1253
02:33:34,680 --> 02:33:43,140
PRA Assistant General Manager Joseph John M. Literal: Sir, under our present, they need approval in all types of reclamations for whatever purpose, Mr.

1254
02:33:43,500 --> 02:33:43,940
Senator Erwin Tulfo: Okay.

1255
02:33:44,640 --> 02:33:46,820
Senator Erwin Tulfo: So, actually, lahat kailangan.

1256
02:33:46,820 --> 02:33:50,460
Senator Erwin Tulfo: Hindi kailangan na yung approval ng DA, hindi kailangan.

1257
02:33:50,620 --> 02:33:51,820
Senator Erwin Tulfo: Kailangan lahat.

1258
02:33:52,060 --> 02:33:52,760
Senator Erwin Tulfo: Pag reclamation.

1259
02:33:53,020 --> 02:33:53,360
PRA Assistant General Manager Joseph John M. Literal: Yes, sir.

1260
02:33:53,480 --> 02:33:53,740
Senator Erwin Tulfo: Alright.

1261
02:33:54,000 --> 02:33:55,320
Senator Erwin Tulfo: One last quick question.

1262
02:33:56,320 --> 02:34:04,680
Senator Erwin Tulfo: What does Taguig need para ikang malift yung ikang cease and desist order?

1263
02:34:05,120 --> 02:34:05,900
PRA Assistant General Manager Joseph John M. Literal: Sir, wala.

1264
02:34:06,280 --> 02:34:09,920
PRA Assistant General Manager Joseph John M. Literal: Sir, may CDO po kami sa DPWH.

1265
02:34:10,620 --> 02:34:14,200
PRA Assistant General Manager Joseph John M. Literal: Sa Taguig City po, yun lang pong letter na yun, Mr. Chair.

1266
02:34:14,760 --> 02:34:15,380
PRA Assistant General Manager Joseph John M. Literal: And your honor.

1267
02:34:15,380 --> 02:34:16,700
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: Thank you, Mr. Chairman.

1268
02:34:17,000 --> 02:34:18,040
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: Pasensya na po kayo.

1269
02:34:18,280 --> 02:34:20,840
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: I'm not emotional at you.

1270
02:34:22,060 --> 02:34:27,240
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: Ang tagigin nyo, more than 500 years na.

1271
02:34:28,280 --> 02:34:36,060
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: Before 2003, even nung impeachment ni President Erap, kumulan ng October hanggang January, baha kami.

1272
02:34:37,640 --> 02:34:39,420
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: Wala kaming mga main road.

1273
02:34:40,460 --> 02:34:46,700
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: Buti ang Makati, may Buendia, may Makati Avenue, may Pasay.

1274
02:34:47,140 --> 02:34:47,320
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: Diba?

1275
02:34:47,920 --> 02:34:49,560
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: Nagawa lang yung Cayetano Boulevard.

1276
02:34:49,560 --> 02:34:50,940
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: Tapos itong General Santos.

1277
02:34:50,940 --> 02:34:54,820
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: Doon sa tinatanong ko sa inyo, kung pamilyar kayo doon sa isa.

1278
02:34:55,560 --> 02:34:59,940
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: So, pag pinag-usapan ang syudad namin, you can investigate.

1279
02:35:00,820 --> 02:35:01,740
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: Everyone is open.

1280
02:35:02,260 --> 02:35:05,800
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: Actually, Mr. Chairman, I'll take the opportunity, kahit sa colleagues natin.

1281
02:35:06,240 --> 02:35:07,660
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: I'd like to be magnanimous.

1282
02:35:07,760 --> 02:35:09,560
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: I thank them for bringing up this issue.

1283
02:35:10,220 --> 02:35:15,380
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: Ang issue ko ay sa DPWH at LLDA at saka sa inyo, tatlo kayong gobyerno.

1284
02:35:15,500 --> 02:35:16,560
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: Ba't hindi kayo mag-usap?

1285
02:35:16,800 --> 02:35:20,820
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: So, attorney, nakausap mo na ba si Secretary Vince Dizon?

1286
02:35:21,700 --> 02:35:22,120
PRA Assistant General Manager Joseph John M. Literal: Yes po.

1287
02:35:22,600 --> 02:35:23,460
PRA Assistant General Manager Joseph John M. Literal: Actually, sir, hindi.

1288
02:35:23,640 --> 02:35:24,420
PRA Assistant General Manager Joseph John M. Literal: Yung USEC po.

1289
02:35:24,660 --> 02:35:25,620
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: Sinong USEC po?

1290
02:35:26,440 --> 02:35:28,820
PRA Assistant General Manager Joseph John M. Literal: Sir, for the LLRN, it's USEC sa Dain.

1291
02:35:29,120 --> 02:35:30,460
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: For the Taguig Project.

1292
02:35:30,540 --> 02:35:36,540
PRA Assistant General Manager Joseph John M. Literal: For the Taguig Project, it's the USEC for the District Engineer, sir.

1293
02:35:36,680 --> 02:35:37,840
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: Hindi pa kayo nagkaayos?

1294
02:35:37,940 --> 02:35:38,880
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: Hindi pa nasubmit lahat?

1295
02:35:38,880 --> 02:35:40,220
PRA Assistant General Manager Joseph John M. Literal: Sir, nasubmit na po sa amin.

1296
02:35:40,500 --> 02:35:43,220
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: Eh, bakit? Meron pang cease and desist order.

1297
02:35:43,520 --> 02:35:46,420
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: By the way, Mr. Chairman, walang pondo yun.

1298
02:35:46,420 --> 02:35:50,280
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: Kaya kahit hindi nyo sinis and desist, may isa lang na tinatapos na project doon.

1299
02:35:50,940 --> 02:35:57,800
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: At yung nasa dyaryo na nag-aayos, bumagyo kasi, nagpaalam sila sa DP na ayusin para hindi bumaksak.

1300
02:35:58,880 --> 02:36:02,860
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: Kasi tinanong ko rin eh, sa DP, ano nangyayari sa inyo?

1301
02:36:03,400 --> 02:36:08,740
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: Kaya yung sinabi ni Secretary Dizon na I'm ordering cease and desist, inorderan niya, sarili niyang tao eh.

1302
02:36:09,280 --> 02:36:10,740
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: Kayo ang nag-order sa kanya.

1303
02:36:11,680 --> 02:36:12,080
PRA Assistant General Manager Joseph John M. Literal: Yes, sir.

1304
02:36:12,180 --> 02:36:12,440
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: Diba?

1305
02:36:12,640 --> 02:36:13,980
PRA Assistant General Manager Joseph John M. Literal: Sir, sa amin, sir, sa DP daw.

1306
02:36:13,980 --> 02:36:14,280
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: Agree.

1307
02:36:14,280 --> 02:36:19,120
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: So, kalukuhan yung pag-order niya sa sarili niyang tao kasi siya ang inorderan nyo.

1308
02:36:19,760 --> 02:36:20,700
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: Okay, number two.

1309
02:36:20,700 --> 02:36:24,780
Senator Alan Peter S. Cayetano: So, wala naman siyang isi-cease and desist doon sa haba na pinapakita sa media.

